  // The cape, far across the bay at the right (some kilometres): a low headland in two planes, the far ridge paler in the air,
  // the near spur running out to the tip; its maquis dark, its cliffs along the water pale where they face the light; the small
  // white light-tower on the rocks at its tip; a seam of foam at its foot and its dim reflection. One sprite per painting.
