  /* motion:hearth:end */

  /* motion:village:start */
  // ---- The village: little chalets and a church, each drawn once into a sprite and then copied (the far cabins of the snow
  // scene, the village and the alpage of the alpes scene). The models are drawn in an oblique view (depth runs up and to the
  // right) in their own units (a wall is 100 wide, the ground is y = 0) and lit by `look`, which the scene fills:
  //   dir: where the light comes from across the picture (-1 left .. 1 right), kl: how directional it is (0 flat .. 1 sun),
  //   sh / li: per-channel multipliers of an albedo in the shade and in the light, alb: the albedos (wall, wood, roof, stone, trim...),
